packages/coding-agent/docs/quickstart.md:201:Platform notes: [Windows](windows.md), [Termux](termux.md), [tmux](tmux.md), [Terminal setup](terminal-setup.md), [Shell aliases](shell-aliases.md).
packages/coding-agent/README.md:10:lunR is a terminal coding agent derived from [pi](https://github.com/badlogic/pi-mono). It ships with interactive TUI, print/JSON, RPC, and SDK modes, plus baked-in MCP, subagents, permissions, plan mode, todos, cron, and a Telegram/Discord gateway.
packages/coding-agent/README.md:71:First-run optional features (Telegram/Discord gateway):
packages/coding-agent/README.md:74:lunr setup
packages/coding-agent/README.md:90:Then just talk to lunR. By default it gives the model four tools: `read`, `write`, `edit`, and `bash`. `grep`, `find`, and `ls` exist but start off. Add more via [skills](#skills), [prompt templates](#prompt-templates), [extensions](#extensions), or [packages](#packages). See [built-in features](docs/features.md) for MCP, subagents, plan mode, cron, and the gateway.
packages/coding-agent/README.md:92:**Platform notes:** [Windows](docs/windows.md) | [Termux (Android)](docs/termux.md) | [tmux](docs/tmux.md) | [Terminal setup](docs/terminal-setup.md) | [Shell aliases](docs/shell-aliases.md)
packages/coding-agent/README.md:119:See [docs/providers.md](docs/providers.md) for setup. **xAI SuperGrok:** `/login xai` can import `~/.grok/auth.json` from the Grok CLI; `/logout xai` does **not** delete that file.
packages/coding-agent/README.md:227:On Windows Terminal, `Alt+Enter` is fullscreen by default. Remap it in [docs/terminal-setup.md](docs/terminal-setup.md) so lunR can receive the follow-up shortcut.
packages/coding-agent/README.md:476:- **Cron** — `/cron`, `~/.lunr/agent/cron/` (TUI live session or gateway origin)
packages/coding-agent/README.md:477:- **Gateway** — `lunr gateway` for Telegram and Discord
packages/coding-agent/README.md:493:lunr setup                         # First-run / reconfigure optional features
packages/coding-agent/README.md:495:lunr gateway […]                   # Chat gateway daemon (requires chat-platforms feature)
packages/coding-agent/README.md:654:Gateway bot tokens (optional) use `LUNR_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` / `LUNR_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` (or `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` / `DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN`) and are stored in `~/.lunr/agent/gateway.json`.
packages/coding-agent/README.md:660:See [docs/development.md](docs/development.md) for setup, forking, and debugging. Source: [github.com/ashx-j/lunR](https://github.com/ashx-j/lunR).
